<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-18764] Cluster snapshot doesn&apos;t restore marshaller data</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18764</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Case:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;There is a cache - IgniteCache&amp;lt;Integer, Account&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;cache.put(0, new BetterAccount()), where BetterAccount extends Account&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;createSnapshot()&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;restoreSnapshot on clean environment&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;cache.get(0) throws java.lang.ClassNotFoundException: Failed to resolve class name &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;platformId=0, platform=Java, typeId=-68243360&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Reason&#160; that Ignite restores binary meta but misses marshaller data.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
